    "detailed_description": "Twizzle Puzzle: Cats - is the perfect puzzle game for a fun and rewarding pastime.<br>Your goal is to assemble a picture of cute cats that has been cut into an equal number of pieces.<br>Rotate the pieces to create the full picture, but think logically about the connections and solve the puzzle. <br>There are 50 levels to complete, and the challenge becomes increasingly difficult as you progress.<br>Enjoy a relaxing time connecting the pieces to create a beautiful picture of cats<br><br>In Twizzle Puzzle: Cats:<br><br>\u202250 levels<br>\u2022Beautiful art<br>\u2022Simple controls (mouse)<br>\u2022Achievements<br>\u2022Relaxing music<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704230/extras/e6932e1ba1eb48e00bdfaadb7e063cf5.poster.avif?t=1745459818\" width=640 height=17 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704230/extras/e6932e1ba1eb48e00bdfaadb7e063cf5.webm?t=1745459818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704230/extras/3e568b3671be40a37471177ab68e54f0.poster.avif?t=1745459818\" width=640 height=95 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704230/extras/3e568b3671be40a37471177ab68e54f0.webm?t=1745459818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704230/extras/5c51de59a5a952af9468cf87dab78acd.avif?t=1745459818\" width=640 height=95 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"htt